                    'Getting started': `快速入门`,
                    'Press Win+V (or your configured shortcut) anywhere in Windows to open ClipNest at your text cursor. Double-click a card or press Enter to paste it with original formatting, or press Shift+Enter to paste as plain text.': `在 Windows 任意位置按 Win+V（或您自定义的快捷键）即可在输入光标旁打开 ClipNest。双击卡片或按 Enter 以原始格式粘贴，按 Shift+Enter 以纯文本粘贴。`,
                    'Smart search & filters': `智能搜索与过滤`,
                    'Type any word to search text, titles, app names, and tags with typo tolerance. Type image, code, link, file, or color to filter by item type (or wrap in quotes like "image" for literal text). Toggle .* for Regex or ~ for strict fuzzy matching.': `输入任意关键词即可搜索文本、标题、应用名称和标签（支持拼写容错）。输入 image、code、link、file 或 color 可按类型过滤（加上引号如 "image" 则搜索原词）。点击 .* 启用正则表达式，点击 ~ 启用模糊匹配。`,
                    'Pinboards & active tab': `分类标签页与激活状态`,
                    'Create colour-coded Pinboards with + or Ctrl+N and drag cards onto any tab. Right-click a Pinboard tab and enable Active pinboard so all new copies go straight into that tab automatically.': `点击 + 或按 Ctrl+N 创建彩色分类，并将卡片拖入任意标签页。右键点击分类标签页并开启“激活分类”，之后所有新复制的内容都会自动存入该分类。`,
                    'Paste Queue & Drop Basket': `粘贴队列与文件收集篮`,
                    'Press Ctrl+Alt+Q to open the floating Queue / Drop Basket window. In Queue mode, copy multiple items and press Ctrl+V repeatedly to paste them in FIFO or LIFO order. In Drop Basket mode, collect files and images from different folders and paste or move them all at once.': `按 Ctrl+Alt+Q 打开悬浮的“粘贴队列 / 文件收集篮”窗口。在队列模式下，连续复制多项内容后重复按 Ctrl+V 即可按顺序逐一粘贴；在文件收集篮模式下，可跨文件夹收集多个文件与图片并一次性粘贴或移动。`,
                    'Right-click inside any folder in Windows File Explorer and select ClipNest to view your copied files and paste them directly into that folder, or right-click any file to add it to the Drop Basket.': `在 Windows 文件资源管理器的任意文件夹中右键点击并选择 ClipNest，即可查看已复制的文件并直接粘贴到该文件夹，或右键点击任意文件将其加入文件收集篮。`,
                    'Text transforms & Persian tools': `文本转换与格式化工具`,
                    'Right-click any text card and choose Transform to convert case, format JSON, encode Base64/URL, normalize Arabic characters and digits to standard Persian/English, or convert all numbers to Persian digits.': `右键点击任意文本卡片并选择“文本转换”，即可转换大小写、美化/压缩 JSON、进行 Base64/URL 编解码或规范化字符与数字。`,
                    'Inside the popup': `主窗口内快捷键`,
                    'Select / extend selection / jump': `选择 / 扩展多选 / 跳转`,
                    'Switch Clipboard ↔ pinboards': `在剪贴板与分类之间切换`,
                    'Paste · plain text · keep formatting': `粘贴 · 纯文本粘贴 · 保留格式粘贴`,
