                    'Actions ▸': `动作 ▸`,
                    Active: `当前活动`,
                    'Active and available': `已启用且可用`,
                    Add: `添加`,
                    'Add tag': `添加标签`,
                    'Adds ClipNest to the right-click context menu of folders and files in Windows Explorer to view and paste copied files or collect files into the Drop Basket.': `将 ClipNest 添加到 Windows 资源管理器文件夹与文件的右键菜单中，以便查看和粘贴已复制的文件或将其收集到文件篮。`,
                    'Already registered by another running application or Windows': `已被其他正在运行的程序或 Windows 占用`,
                    'On: wraps category tabs into multiple rows (like VS Code wrapTabs). Off: scrolls category tabs horizontally with mouse wheel or click-and-drag.': `开启：将分类标签换行显示为多行（类似 VS Code wrapTabs）。关闭：使用鼠标滚轮或拖拽横向滚动标签。`,
                    'When enabled (default), pinning an item inside a category only pins it in that category, without pinning it in the main Clipboard tab.': `启用后（默认），在分类内置顶项目仅在该分类中置顶，而不会在主“剪贴板”标签页中置顶。`,
                    'Applied instantly to the popup, queue and settings windows. Needs Windows 10 2004+ for “Invisible”. Does not work inside Remote Desktop sessions.': `立即应用于弹窗、队列和设置窗口。“完全隐身”需要 Windows 10 2004+，在远程桌面会话中无效。`,
                    'Arabic Yeh/Kaf → Persian (ی ک)': `阿拉伯语 Yeh/Kaf → 波斯语 (ی ک)`,
