                    'Auto-delete after N minutes': `N 分钟后自动删除`,
                    'Automatically saves text changes in the inline preview editor after a short pause without requiring Ctrl+S.': `在内联预览编辑器中修改文本后稍作停顿即自动保存，无需按 Ctrl+S。`,
