                    'Card numbers (Luhn), API keys (sk-…, ghp_…, AKIA…), private keys, JWTs.': `银行卡号 (Luhn)、API 密钥 (sk-…、ghp_…、AKIA…)、私钥、JWT。`,
                    Case: `大小写转换`,
                    'Category settings…': `分类设置…`,
                    'Choose any installed system font on your computer for rendering clipboard cards and previews.': `选择电脑上已安装的任意系统字体来渲染剪贴板卡片和预览。`,
                    'Choose how much vertical padding each card uses in the popup list.': `选择列表中每张卡片的垂直内边距。`,
                    'Choose the colour scheme for the popup, queue, and settings windows.': `选择弹窗、队列和设置窗口的配色方案。`,
                    'Choose the colour scheme for the popup, queue, and settings windows (System follows Windows Dark/Light mode automatically).': `选择弹窗、队列和设置窗口的配色方案（“跟随系统”会自动匹配 Windows 深色/浅色模式）。`,
                    'Choose the primary highlight colour for borders, badges, and active controls.': `选择边框、徽标和活动控件的主高亮颜色。`,
