                    'Copy something — it is added here.': `复制任意内容 — 它会添加到这里。`,
                    'Count chars / words / lines': `统计字符 / 词数 / 行数`,
                    'Create a compressed snapshot of the SQLite database right now.': `立即创建 SQLite 数据库的压缩快照备份。`,
                    'Create backup': `创建备份`,
                    'Create colour-coded Categories with + or Ctrl+N and drag cards onto any tab (hold Ctrl while dragging from a category to copy instead of move). Right-click a Category tab and enable Active category so all new copies go straight into that tab automatically.': `使用 + 或 Ctrl+N 创建彩色分类并将卡片拖到任意标签上（从分类中拖拽时按住 Ctrl 可复制而非移动）。右键点击分类标签并启用“活动分类”，新复制的内容将自动进入该分类。`,
                    'Ctrl + Click on card': `Ctrl + 点击卡片`,
