                    'Custom action': `自定义动作`,
                    'Custom title (empty to clear)': `自定义标题（留空以清除）`,
                    'Daily automatic backup': `每日自动备份`,
                    'Automatically creates a compressed daily snapshot in the backups folder.': `每天自动在备份文件夹中创建压缩快照。`,
                    Dark: `深色`,
                    'Database encryption and per-tab locking are not part of this version.': `此版本不包含数据库加密和分类密码锁定功能。`,
