                    'Drop Basket: allow Cut (move files after verified copy)': `文件篮：允许剪切（验证复制成功后移动文件）`,
                    'When enabled, files cut with Ctrl+X are moved only after destination copy and exact byte size are verified on disk.': `启用后，使用 Ctrl+X 剪切的文件仅在目标文件复制完成且字节大小校验无误后才会移动。`,
                    'Edit (Ctrl+E)': `编辑 (Ctrl+E)`,
                    'Enable subtle Notion-style transitions for menus, dialogs, and hover states.': `为菜单、对话框和悬停状态启用柔和的 Notion 风格过渡动画。`,
                    Encode: `编码转换`,
                    'Engine & Architecture': `引擎与架构`,
                    English: `英语`,
                    'Erase all unpinned history?': `清空所有未置顶的历史记录？`,
                    'Every copy is written to disk immediately (SQLite WAL, full fsync), so a power cut cannot lose a completed copy.': `每次复制都会立即写入磁盘（SQLite WAL + 完整 fsync），断电也不会丢失已完成的复制记录。`,
                    Executable: `可执行文件 (.exe)`,
                    'Exit ClipNest completely and stop background clipboard monitoring.': `完全退出 ClipNest 并停止后台剪贴板监听。`,
                    'Export / import settings': `导出 / 导入设置`,
                    'Export history': `导出历史记录`,
                    'Export…': `导出…`,
                    'Farsi digits (۰۱۲۳۴۵۶۷۸۹)': `波斯数字 (۰۱۲۳۴۵۶۷۸۹)`,
                    'First copied → first pasted': `先复制 → 先粘贴 (FIFO)`,
                    'Font size (px)': `字体大小 (px)`,
                    'Base font size in pixels across the popup, queue, and settings windows.': `弹窗、队列和设置窗口的基础字体像素大小。`,
                    'Formats (Ctrl+I)': `格式检查 (Ctrl+I)`,
                    'Formats (MIME inspector)': `格式 (MIME 检查器)`,
                    'Global hotkey to pause or resume clipboard capturing.': `暂停或恢复剪贴板捕获的全局快捷键。`,
                    'Globalhotkey to pause or resume clipboard capturing.': `暂停或恢复剪贴板捕获的全局快捷键。`,
                    'Global hotkey to open or close the Paste Queue / Drop Basket window.': `打开或关闭“粘贴队列 / 文件篮”窗口的全局快捷键。`,
                    'Global hotkey to show or hide the main ClipNest popup.': `显示或隐藏 ClipNest 主弹窗的全局快捷键。`,
